IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BINTCLI.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-OP PIC X(20).
01 WS-A PIC X(24).
01 WS-B PIC X(20).
01 WS-C PIC X(20).
01 WS-D PIC X(20).
01 WS-E PIC X(20).
01 WS-AMT PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
01 WS-BPS PIC S9(05).
01 WS-DAYS PIC 9(05).
01 WS-BASIS PIC 9(03).
01 WS-FEE PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
01 WS-INT-ED PIC -(15)9.99.
01 WS-RATE-ED PIC -(1)9.9(6).
COPY "BINTP".

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 WS-LINE PIC X(1000).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING WS-LINE.
    PERFORM PARSE-LINE
    MOVE 0 TO WS-AMT WS-BPS WS-DAYS WS-BASIS WS-FEE
    IF WS-A NOT = SPACES
        MOVE WS-A TO WS-AMT
    END-IF
    IF WS-B NOT = SPACES
        MOVE WS-B TO WS-BPS
    END-IF
    IF WS-C NOT = SPACES
        MOVE WS-C TO WS-DAYS
    END-IF
    IF WS-D NOT = SPACES
        MOVE WS-D TO WS-BASIS
    END-IF
    IF WS-E NOT = SPACES
        MOVE WS-E TO WS-FEE
    END-IF
    MOVE WS-AMT TO INT-AMOUNT
    MOVE WS-BPS TO INT-BPS
    MOVE WS-DAYS TO INT-DAYS
    MOVE WS-BASIS TO INT-BASIS
    MOVE WS-FEE TO INT-FEE
    EVALUATE WS-OP
        WHEN "accrue" MOVE "ACCRUE" TO INT-OP
        WHEN "compound" MOVE "COMPOUND" TO INT-OP
        WHEN "fee" MOVE "FEE" TO INT-OP
        WHEN OTHER MOVE SPACES TO INT-OP
    END-EVALUATE
    IF INT-OP = SPACES
        DISPLAY "rc=20"
        DISPLAY "msg=UNKNOWN INTEREST OP"
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    CALL "BINT" USING BK-INT-REQ
    DISPLAY "rc=" INT-RC
    MOVE INT-INTEREST TO WS-INT-ED
    MOVE INT-RATE TO WS-RATE-ED
    DISPLAY "interest=" WS-INT-ED
    DISPLAY "rate=" WS-RATE-ED
    DISPLAY "msg=" FUNCTION TRIM(INT-MSG)
    GOBACK.

PARSE-LINE.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-OP WS-A WS-B WS-C WS-D WS-E
    UNSTRING WS-LINE DELIMITED BY "|"
        INTO WS-OP WS-A WS-B WS-C WS-D WS-E
    END-UNSTRING.
